<title>UK: Babcock Intl H1 pretax profit 4.7 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Babcock Intl H1 pretax profit 4.7 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 1.8		   vs   10.77</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  0.625		 vs    1.25</p>
<p> Pretax			4.7		   vs   19.2</p>
<p> Turnover		  319.7		   vs  393.7</p>
<p> Interest		    1.00		  vs   0.94</p>
<p> Tax			   1.17		  vs   0.72</p>
<p> Net taxed		   3.51		  vs  18.46</p>
<p> Pay date		   January 30, 1996</p>
<p>Div registration date  January 3, 1997  Ex-div date		December 23, 1996</p>
<p>Note: Babcock, the engineering group, pretax profit included 2.0 million stg of exceptional gains. It said its order book as on September 30, 1996 stood at 414 million stg as against 406 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
